WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,170
Sister Ji, let me return this rope mark to you.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,370
This is an offensive four-connection treasure.

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,370
One piece outside can sell for more than thirty kilograms.

4
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:08,870
You just gave it to me

5
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,870
I'm still more accustomed to using my Thousand Star Sword

6
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:13,870
In addition, the combat skills that I assist in training have always been sword skills.

7
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,370
The rope mark really doesn’t suit me

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:18,500
Besides, this spiritual treasure belongs to Sister Shi.

9
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,500
No matter how precious the spiritual treasure is, it cannot compare with the friendship between the same people.

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,500
That day Hou San's Baowen dog training went crazy

11
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Sister Shi was the first one to rush up to Tailan in front of me.

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,500
Kindness is hard to repay

13
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,410
Why are you so polite?

14
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,670
I'm your sister Shi

15
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,670
Isn’t it natural for me to help you?

16
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:38,830
You help me welcome the rope back and mark it with a bad breath

17
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,330
I owe you a favor

18
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:42,830
Don't forget to report to VIPs within five days.

19
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,840
I have to go back to the cave to practice. I’m leaving now.
